s and avoid stunning barrages.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525660/extras/98759db0091a0636f08e45329906674f.webp?t=1772604984\" width=600 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525660/extras/bfa824b04992a85357dc79df89f4ec2f.poster.avif?t=1772604984\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525660/extras/bfa824b04992a85357dc79df89f4ec2f.webm?t=1772604984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525660/extras/bfa824b04992a85357dc79df89f4ec2f.mp4?t=1772604984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Watch unique death scenes for every moment you may fall in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > After facing the wrath of a enemy comeback with better knowledge and strategize your next attack.<br>A Unholy Comet has crashed upon the world and has broken into multiple large pieces scattering across the lands. One of the smaller fragments has impacted the countryside of Grimthorn. The Impact site has begun to spread corruption through the lands waking the dead and infecting the living turning them into devils. These corrupted impact sites from then on were known as Dead Wells.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Hack, Slash, Parry and Dodge your foes in this Souls-like Action RPG. Explore the countryside in search of The Devil Fragment while fighting enemies with a multi game inspired combat system where you can launch foes into the air and then juggle them to build your combo meter for multiple buffs.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.